{"game": "crab-champions", "language": "english", "appid": 774801, "month": "2024-05", "window": 1, "start_date": 1714521600, "end_date": 1715126399, "month_true_total": 534, "quota": 7, "returned": 7, "pulled_at": "2026-09-30 05:48:36 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "164872905", "author": {"steamid": "76561198071839867", "personaname": "Pope Paula", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Poplyol/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 1690, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1130, "last_played": 1743296961, "avatar": "63b48783b242e929bcd0cd67158f6c51e2d2a04d"}, "language": "english", "review": "fun, needs some improvement but it gets updates still and almost all of them have majorly improved this already good dame so far, so would recommend 8/10", "timestamp_created": 1715119688, "timestamp_updated": 1715119688, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "164862962", "author": {"steamid": "76561199545585831", "personaname": "ghoopsie", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199545585831/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 866, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 193, "last_played": 1751771229, "avatar": "3e9ac3c317aa098ba2f2eebc903b40a62c53aaa3"}, "language": "english", "review": "good.", "timestamp_created": 1715111251, "timestamp_updated": 1715111251, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "164859536", "author": {"steamid": "76561198130420155", "personaname": "FunkYTown", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198130420155/", "num_games_owned": 143, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 5088, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3874, "last_played": 1762218284, "avatar": "042017b54af7e27a5f5b157aa91bea76efdce41b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Somehow fairly balanced while simultaneously not balanced at all. Gives it kind of a unique edge among roguelikes. I've only ever played on the highest difficulty and I either become a god and have an easy run or get chewed up and spit out by the games INCREDIBLY harsh enemy ai. Enemies in this game are somehow able to fire a shot that takes nearly 5 whole seconds to reach you, and without altering its trejectory in the slightest, manage to hit you with it. \r\n\r\nOverall a surprisingly good roguelike and especially worth the very cheap cost. Also a pretty decent game for completionists, as there are a solid amount of achievements and none of them are particularly insane to get.", "timestamp_created": 1715108444, "timestamp_updated": 1715108444, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "164858559", "author": {"steamid": "76561198120361701", "personaname": "Majeo", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198120361701/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 1596, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1596, "last_played": 1704615551, "avatar": "e5bc7830f5f3488d0aa6b99c70992dc28fbbb81b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Good.", "timestamp_created": 1715107682, "timestamp_up